# ~/.config/git/config — 共通設定（git が ~/.config/git/config を自動で読む）
# PC ごとの値 (user.name / user.email / http.* など) は ~/.gitconfig_local に書く
[user]
	name = user
	email = user@example.com
[core]
	editor = vim
	eol = lf
	autocrlf = false
	symlinks = true
	longpaths = true
	excludesfile = ~/.gitignore_global
	whitespace = cr-at-eol,tab-in-indent,trail,space-before-tab
[apply]
	whitespace = fix
[pull]
	ff = only
	rebase = false
[color]
	ui = true
[merge]
	tool = p4merge
[mergetool]
	keepBackup = false
[mergetool "p4merge"]
	path = p4merge
	keepTemporaries = false
	trustExitCode = false
[filter "lfs"]
	required = true
	clean = git-lfs clean -- %f
	smudge = git-lfs smudge -- %f
	process = git-lfs filter-process
